on":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-02-14T12:54:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-14T13:55:53Z","closed_at":"2026-02-14T13:38:09Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in master\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (b7d9c7b70) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 31.0.21923.11000) - AMD Ryzen 5 5500U with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 7.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using lambdas to connect to signals and when the current file doesn't end with a new line, the \"Expected end of file\" error pops up:\n\n<img width=\"974\" height=\"288\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abcd161e-3647-4d5b-b04f-854b265406ae\" />\n\nThis doesn't happen if a method is passed instead:\n\n<img width=\"960\" height=\"290\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94bcabe7-0576-477d-909a-cf05474997c7\" />\n\nAnd it doesn't happen if there's a new line at the end of the file:\n\n<img width=\"975\" height=\"297\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5e2433c-6d0f-41cf-a7e9-d5451bc847f0\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new GDScript script.\n2. Paste the next code into it:\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc test() -> void:\n\tpass\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tProjectSettings.settings_changed.connect(func()->void:print(\"Hello world\"))\n```\n 3. Make sure there's no new line at the end of the file\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc test() -> void:\n\tpass\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tProjectSettings.settings_changed.connect(func()->void:print(\"Hello world\"))\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116285/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116285/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}